01:40.957 --> 01:46.507
The Ten Tails' Jinchuriki

01:47.787 --> 01:50.037
The Ten Tails disappeared?

01:55.497 --> 01:58.127
What's going on?
Did they defeat it?

01:58.207 --> 01:59.167
No...

01:59.497 --> 02:01.127
Hinata! Did you see it?

02:01.677 --> 02:02.467
Yeah!

02:02.927 --> 02:05.267
Can you explain
what happened?

02:43.177 --> 02:47.467
Ten Tails was completely
absorbed into that man.

02:48.137 --> 02:49.677
Based on looking at its chakra.

02:51.307 --> 02:52.967
Don't tell me...

03:06.057 --> 03:07.767
That's the Ten Tails'...

03:16.097 --> 03:17.517
Jinchuriki?

03:18.217 --> 03:20.517
<i>What is this?!</i>

03:21.887 --> 03:25.717
<i>This is bad.</i>
<i>Jinchuriki, huh?</i>

03:37.267 --> 03:39.927
He looks even creepier
than before!

03:40.807 --> 03:41.767
Obito...

03:42.887 --> 03:43.927
Naruto...

03:43.927 --> 03:46.097
How can you tell
he's a Jinchuriki?

03:47.097 --> 03:49.137
I've become friends
with the Tailed Beasts.

03:49.517 --> 03:51.967
They gave me some
of their chakra earlier,

03:52.057 --> 03:53.847
so it's obvious to me.

03:54.517 --> 03:57.767
I could sense the Tailed Beasts' chakra
getting sucked into Obito

03:57.847 --> 03:59.387
one after the other.

04:00.347 --> 04:05.057
Plus, I've seen Nagato do that
Six Paths Rebirth Jutsu before.

04:06.467 --> 04:10.557
But the signs he was weaving
were completely different!

04:11.177 --> 04:13.387
Anyway, he was performing
the jutsu

04:13.467 --> 04:15.467
to become a Jinchuriki
all this time.

04:15.967 --> 04:16.967
I see...

04:26.057 --> 04:29.017
Eight-o! Is that the final form?

04:29.927 --> 04:31.847
No, it's not.

04:32.267 --> 04:34.767
It's hard to explain,
but that isn't it.

04:34.847 --> 04:37.677
Looks like Ten Tails was
used to create a Jinchuriki

04:37.767 --> 04:39.557
before it reached its final form.

04:46.177 --> 04:48.427
<i>Even if you have become</i>
<i>a Jinchuriki,</i>

04:48.517 --> 04:50.767
<i>the Gracious Deity Gates</i>
<i>are still in play.</i>

04:54.967 --> 04:57.097
Whoa! Amazing!

05:02.017 --> 05:02.967
No...

05:44.517 --> 05:47.307
<i>The Sage Art Seal that</i>
<i>suppressed the Ten Tails was...</i>

05:48.307 --> 05:50.097
<i>Such power...</i>

06:19.847 --> 06:20.847
What?!

06:40.967 --> 06:41.847
Impossible!

06:41.927 --> 06:43.807
The Four Crimson Rays Formation!

06:44.057 --> 06:45.307
Is it just me,

06:45.387 --> 06:47.887
or is he stronger than
when he was gigantic?

06:48.137 --> 06:51.597
Before, it was just throwing
its power around.

06:51.677 --> 06:54.137
But now, it's learned to focus it.

06:55.807 --> 06:57.637
Everyone, keep your guard up!

06:58.057 --> 07:00.217
We don't know what that man,

07:00.307 --> 07:03.847
who made the Ten Tails' power
his own, might do!

07:04.097 --> 07:05.847
He's broken the barrier!

07:15.097 --> 07:17.467
Enough! Obito, stop this!

07:20.927 --> 07:23.927
O... bi... to?

07:29.517 --> 07:33.597
I'll be blunt.
This guy is stronger than me!

07:34.097 --> 07:37.017
No offense,
but it appears so.

07:37.557 --> 07:39.717
Even if you reabsorb
your remaining clones,

07:39.807 --> 07:41.307
you're no match, Elder Brother!

07:41.387 --> 07:42.597
I know.

07:43.597 --> 07:44.717
However...

08:01.097 --> 08:04.637
It would be fun to watch
all the Hokage beg for mercy,

08:04.717 --> 08:06.847
but I cannot wait any longer.

08:11.017 --> 08:14.347
<i>Obito is now just like</i>
<i>the Sage of Six Paths.</i>

08:14.467 --> 08:17.927
<i>I can't let him take the lead</i>
<i>before I use my trump card.</i>

08:35.017 --> 08:35.887
What's happened?

08:35.887 --> 08:36.927
<i>He's so fast!</i>

08:36.927 --> 08:38.887
Saru! Fourth! Scram!

08:40.017 --> 08:43.467
<i>This is Lord Second's attack plan!</i>

08:52.307 --> 08:53.847
– Elder Brother!
– Mm-hmm!

08:54.347 --> 08:55.597
<b>EXPLODE</b>

08:58.387 --> 09:00.307
Minato, get away!

09:00.597 --> 09:02.637
Lord Second,
you sure work fast!

09:02.887 --> 09:04.387
<i>Flying Raijin Jutsu!</i>

09:05.967 --> 09:08.517
I suspected that might
not be enough to kill you...

09:09.057 --> 09:11.097
I created the Reanimation Jutsu,

09:11.177 --> 09:13.017
as well as ancillary jutsu
to go with it.

09:15.137 --> 09:17.717
Though this is the first time
I'm using it on myself.

09:21.637 --> 09:24.467
<i>There it is!</i>
<i>The Lord Second's special...</i>

09:24.557 --> 09:26.557
<i>Tandem Explosive Tags!</i>

09:26.847 --> 09:27.967
This is how it's done!

09:28.967 --> 09:32.017
<i>Each tag summons more tags,</i>
<i>resulting in continuous explosions.</i>

09:32.097 --> 09:34.717
<i>Concentrated and focused</i>
<i>consecutive explosions!</i>

09:45.767 --> 09:48.847
This is too much!
What's going on? I can't keep up!

09:48.927 --> 09:50.177
Don't freak out!

09:50.267 --> 09:52.017
Always keep one eye on
what's happening around you!

10:00.597 --> 10:03.097
I don't care if that is
the Jinchuriki of the Ten Tails!

10:03.637 --> 10:05.807
The Lords Hokage are
engaged in battle!

10:05.887 --> 10:06.887
We have to join them!

10:06.967 --> 10:08.017
Don't be hasty! We need to—!

10:08.137 --> 10:11.177
All of you!
You must not approach heedlessly!

10:37.717 --> 10:39.927
What is he?

11:06.927 --> 11:08.547
<i>He's solid and swift.</i>

11:08.637 --> 11:11.717
<i>And he has an attack that</i>
<i>turns all to dust in an instant!</i>

11:18.757 --> 11:20.967
Shuriken Shadow Clones!

11:30.967 --> 11:34.547
<i>It's similar to Ohnoki's Particle Style,</i>
<i>but its shape is fluid.</i>

11:34.637 --> 11:37.047
<i>It can shift to be either</i>
<i>offensive or defensive.</i>

11:37.137 --> 11:38.597
<i>And can be continuously maintained.</i>

11:43.007 --> 11:47.427
<i>I suspect it's a combination of more</i>
<i>than four Changes in Chakra Nature!</i>

11:47.507 --> 11:50.967
<i>This is more than a Kekkei Genkai</i>
<i> or even a Kekkei Touta...</i>

11:56.137 --> 11:58.257
<i>But there seems to be</i>
<i>a time limit to how long</i>

11:58.347 --> 12:00.007
<i>he can use each</i>
<i>Change in Chakra Form.</i>

12:06.467 --> 12:07.597
Gramps!

12:08.137 --> 12:13.007
Dad! You couldn't teleport
Grandpa Third with your jutsu too?

12:13.097 --> 12:16.097
It's impossible. I can't teleport
anything that I myself,

12:16.177 --> 12:18.597
or my chakra isn't touching directly.

12:19.177 --> 12:20.467
Calm down, Naruto.

12:20.847 --> 12:22.547
The Hokage are Reanimations.

12:23.047 --> 12:25.467
They intentionally attacked head-on
knowing that they won't die,

12:25.547 --> 12:28.467
in order to check out
the enemy's moves and abilities.

12:29.217 --> 12:32.467
Stop worrying and analyze
the battle instead.

12:33.427 --> 12:36.257
<i>So that's Sasuke...</i>
<i>He's extremely smart.</i>

12:37.047 --> 12:40.427
Although it still takes a while
for a Reanimation to regenerate.

12:47.137 --> 12:49.427
I'll go first and create an opening!

12:50.257 --> 12:52.467
At this point, I feel the need to...

12:58.597 --> 13:01.677
I'm done waiting, Hashirama!

13:30.387 --> 13:32.007
W-What's going on?

13:39.547 --> 13:40.507
<i>I get it...</i>

13:40.597 --> 13:44.137
<i>Ten Tails hasn't completely</i>
<i>synched with its Jinchuriki yet.</i>

13:44.547 --> 13:46.507
<i>This is our chance to take it down!</i>

13:47.257 --> 13:48.797
<i>I'll summon my original here then!</i>

13:50.797 --> 13:52.677
It's been a while, but it's time

13:52.757 --> 13:55.007
